/Subject (Typical\040data\040science\040instruction\040uses\040generic\040datasets\040like\040survival\040rates\040on\040the\040Titanic\054\040which\040may\040not\040be\040motivating\040for\040students\056\040This\040study\040contrasted\040learning\040with\040generic\040datasets\040and\040artificial\040problems\040\050phase\0401\051\040with\040a\040community\040sourced\040dataset\040and\040authentic\040problems\040\050phase\0402\051\040in\040the\040context\040of\040an\0408\040week\040virtual\040internship\056\040Retrospective\040survey\040questions\040indicated\040interns\040experienced\040increased\040motivation\040in\040phase\0402\056\040Additionally\054\040analysis\040of\040intern\040discourse\040using\040Linguistic\040Inquiry\040and\040Word\040Count\040\050LIWC\051\040indicated\040a\040significant\040difference\040in\040linguistic\040measures\040between\040the\040two\040phases\056\040Phase\0402\040had\040significantly\040greater\040measures\040of\040words\040per\040sentence\054\040analytic\040thinking\054\040clout\040\050i\056e\056\040confidence\051\054\040affect\054\040positive\040emotion\054\040certainty\054\040drives\054\040and\040affiliation\054\040and\040significantly\040smaller\040measures\040of\040word\040count\054\040cognitive\040processes\054\040negative\040emotion\054\040and\040emotional\040tone\056\040These\040results\040suggest\040that\040community\040sourced\040data\040and\040problems\040may\040increase\040motivation\040for\040learning\040data\040science\056)
